**purposive** (' an anomalous form '— OED) is one of the ^^HYBRID DERIVATIVES^^ described in the article of that name as *spurious*; the Latin suffix *-ive* is unsuited to the delatinized & anglogallicized *pur-*, which represents but conceals the Latin *pro.*
